          "end": 401.14,
          "en": "Now fetch returns a promise as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 401.14,
          "end": 404.47,
          "en": "So we can use then to define the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 404.47,
          "end": 406.77,
          "en": "that should execute once this request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
